Loop by TerraCycle is a global refillable packaging system that brings reusable containers and on-the-go refill services to consumers. The platform partners with major brands to offer personal care, food, and household products in durable, reusable containers delivered via e-commerce or retail partners. Empty containers are collected, cleaned, and refilled in a closed-loop cycle, eliminating single-use packaging waste. Loop demonstrates that refill systems can integrate seamlessly into existing shopping habits, providing convenience equal to single-use alternatives while fundamentally shifting material flows from linear to circular at scale.